OL,3,GNEWSAPeter Rabbit trail sculptures to
OL,4,Abe auctioned off
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of hand-painted Peter Rabbit
OL,7,Fsculptures that formed a city trail for
OL,8,Fthe summer are due to be auctioned off.
OL,10,FThe 96 Peter Rabbit sculptures were
OL,11,Fdotted around Newcastle and North
OL,12,FTyneside for nine weeks, with people
OL,13,Fencouraged to visit and snap a photo of
OL,14,Feach one.
OL,16,FWhile the beloved Beatrix Potter
OL,17,Fcharacter was free to view, paid-for
OL,18,Factivities such as a sticker book and
OL,19,Fapp supported work of the charity St
OL,20,FOswald's Hospice.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
