OL,3,GNEWSAPeter Rabbit trail sculptures to
OL,4,Abe auctioned off
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trail was removed earlier this
OL,7,Fmonth and the sculptures are due to be
OL,8,Fauctioned off to raise money for the
OL,9,Fsame charity.
